  "prefLabel": "Ph 2506.01 Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2506.01 Definitions. “Automated electronic emergency drug kit” means an automated pharmacy system used for the immediate administration to patients or residents upon the order of a practitioner as set forth in rules adopted under RSA 151:2.\n\nSource. #13465, eff 12-19-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
